{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e1bfd6006945d280058b","chatId":"392c88b08b684ae78cdbba92d3c33aa1","sessionId":null,"userId":56618,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[B]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[B]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1041,"promptTokens":1555,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:15"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021827161857130625,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1bfd6006945d280058a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367935628,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e1bfd6006945d280058a","chatId":"392c88b08b684ae78cdbba92d3c33aa1","sessionId":null,"userId":56618,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n依林，思雅和箐箐是好友，但最近思雅误会了箐箐。一天，他们在图书馆。正在学习的依林看到箐箐走过来，箐箐脸色看起来有些怪异。思雅正在寻找学习资料，箐箐看到之后立刻转头离开。依林看着箐箐的背影，深深叹了口气，又看了看不远处的思雅，眼神暗示着什么。思雅看着依林的动作，但并未采取行动。依林默默的摇了摇头，继续低头学习。\n\n[问题]\n你觉得依林心情如何？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 依林感到困惑，因为她不知道思雅和箐箐为什么变成这样。\nB. 依林感受到无奈，因为思雅无视了她的暗示，她没办法帮助两位朋友和好。\nC. 依林感到生气，因为思雅无视了她的眼神和示意。\nD. 依林到快乐，因为思雅和她的关系没有收到任何影响。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0021827161857130625,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1bfd6006945d280058b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367935625,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:15","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4e3ce5c6509f4cf8963940c6ed7126dd"}